type: software
title: xrdkit
abstract: >-
  A reusable X-ray diffraction analysis toolkit for electroceramics research,
  covering pattern reading, peak finding, indexing, lattice refinement, size
  and strain analysis, phase matching and unattended GSAS-II Rietveld
  refinement.
